  "body": "`ServiceWorkerRegistration.showNotification()` has an `icon` and `image` options. It is not clear from the standard whether those resources must be served over https or if http is acceptable as well.\r\n\r\nMoreover Firefox and Chrome have different behaviors: Firefox shows the icons over http, while Chrome doesn't display icons and images served over http (see [related Chromium issue](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=922083)).\r\n\r\nPlease clarify if HTTPS is required or not.",
